This repository is worked on in turn by Claude Code, Cursor and Codex.

- Before starting, read `AGENTS.md` (rules + hand-off protocol) and
  `docs/ai-handoff/PROGRESS.md` (current state, completed work, open items, session log).
- Follow the hard rules in `AGENTS.md`: no commit/push/deploy/production migration without the
  user's explicit approval; never discard others' uncommitted changes; isolated test resources
  only; keep the non-monetary boundary.
- Before you stop or run low on context, update `docs/ai-handoff/PROGRESS.md` as described in
  `AGENTS.md` ("End of every session").
